ay Tracing in One Weekend - .gitignore
# ==========================================

# --- Output Images ---
# The book outputs images in the .ppm format. 
# Keep your repository clean by ignoring the rendered images.
*.ppm
*.png
*.jpg
*.bmp

# --- Build & Execution Artifacts ---
# Compiled binaries, object files, and libraries
*.o
*.obj
*.out
*.exe
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib

# --- CMake Build Directories ---
# If you use CMake to configure the project, ignore the build folder
/build/
/.cmake/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
Makefile
cmake_install.cmake

# --- IDEs and Text Editors ---
# VS Code
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json

# Visual Studio (Windows)
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.sln
*.vcxproj
*.filters

# CLion / JetBrains
.idea/
cmake-build-debug/
cmake-build-release/

# Xcode (macOS)
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
.DS_Store

# --- Miscellaneous ---
# Log files or crash dumps
*.log
*.pbm
*.pgm
